title: mfr_mime_undetected
tags: [[Reserved field]] [[File metadata fields]]
kind: reference
summary: That reconcile read the file's content and found no MIME type in it.

Set in place of [[mfr_mime]] when the content says nothing `infer` recognises (plain
text, for one), so that reconcile does not open the file again each time. Clear it to
have the type looked for again ([[File metadata fields]]).
